    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L03-ACTIVITY-015",
      "SourceSection": "3.3: Let’s Make Some Curves",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Graphs of polynomials have a variety of appearances. Here are three graphs of different polynomials with degree 1, 3, and 6, respectively:",
